# Project rules — full notes in CLAUDE.md

- FrameContainer's child is the positional `self[1]`; never pass it as a named field.
- Menu items must be registered in the order tables BEFORE MenuSorter merges, or they are silently dropped.
- Never monkey-patch KOReader plugin modules (they are dofile'd); only require-loaded core modules.
- Deploy over the SSH exec channel (KOReader's SSH server has no SFTP); verify md5 on both sides.
- Run `lua test/harness.lua` AND `luajit test/harness.lua` before deploying; stubs must mirror real widget semantics.
- Keep README.md, patchnotes.md, spec.md, and the patch header version in sync with every change.
